# Armada durable design

## Three keys (do not substitute)

| Key | Owns |
| --- | --- |
| window + workspace | dispatch / inject routing |
| `conversation_id` | which events belong on a run |
| `generation_id` | busy vs idle |

Completed-turn **assistant body** comes from cid-owned transcript. Hooks are in-flight only. Do not drop jsonl because hooks contain `run.prompt`. `afterAgentResponse.text` may be empty.

## Forbidden

Prompt string / `includes` as stop or reconstruction gates. Dual-track latches. Thought text as fake body. Per-incident special cases.

```text
❌ BAD: hookHasPrompt(fromHooks, prompt) → discard transcript
✅ GOOD: ingest enforces cid; eventsToChat keeps cid-owned jsonl; stop matches generation_id
```

## Feasibility then full fix

Failing test on the real event shape first. Then one shared-boundary change. Adjacent gaps: tell the developer, do not silently expand.
